concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-1-sec-72-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "72(6) Changes on grounds of hardship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-72-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The regulations may provide for subsections (2), (3), (4) and (5) to have effect in relation to credit contracts prescribed by the regulations as if a particular reference in subsection (2) or (5) to a ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 1  Enhancements" ;
