concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-1-sec-9-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9(5) Subsections 94(3) and (4) of the National Credit Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (2) and (3) are offences of strict liability. Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Enhancements  Schedule 1 Remedies for unfair or dishonest conduct by credit service providers  Part 2" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (2) and (3) are offences of strict liability. Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Enhancements  Schedule 1 Remedies for unfair or dishonest conduct by credit service providers  Part 2"@en ;
