    skos:definition "(2) The orders are as follows:  (a) an order that the defendant take, or refrain from taking, specified action;  (b) an order that the defendant pay the plaintiff a specified amount;  (c) an order that a specified amount is not due or owing by the plaintiff to the defendant;  (d) any other order the court considers appropriate to: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 1  Enhancements"@en ;
