concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-2-sec-67a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "67A Changes to tenancy protection in credit contracts for reverse"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-67a ;
    values:originalText "mortgages  A purported change to a credit contract for a reverse mortgage that makes provision for a person other than the debtor to occupy the reverse mortgaged property is void so far as the change purports to:  (a) remove a provision required by subsection 17(15A) to be contained in the contract document; or  (b) vary the contract so as to limit:  (i) the ability of the debtor to nominate to the credit provider a person who is to be allowed to occupy the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 2  Reverse mortgages" ;
    skos:definition "mortgages  A purported change to a credit contract for a reverse mortgage that makes provision for a person other than the debtor to occupy the reverse mortgaged property is void so far as the change purports to:  (a) remove a provision required by subsection 17(15A) to be contained in the contract document; or  (b) vary the contract so as to limit:  (i) the ability of the debtor to nominate to the credit provider a person who is to be allowed to occupy the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 2  Reverse mortgages"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f3ce7a25ccf1396f516434521f212ba9f2c9a91812852a9673bcafded0d09ffa" ;
    cof:pageNumber "45"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Voiding of changes to credit contracts for reverse mortgages" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf> ;
