concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-2-sec-86b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86B Discharge of debtor’s obligations under credit contract and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-86b ;
    values:originalText "discharge of mortgage  (1) The debtor’s obligations under the credit contract are discharged by force of this subsection.  (2) The mortgage securing those obligations is discharged by force of this subsection. Note: This section does not apply in some cases: see section 86E." ;
