concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-2-sec-86e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86E Cases in which sections 86B, 86C and 86D do not apply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-86e ;
    values:originalText "Sections 86B, 86C and 86D do not apply if:  (b) the debtor engaged in fraud, or made a misrepresentation, relating to the reverse mortgage before, at or after the time the credit contract was made; or  (c) circumstances prescribed by the regulations exist." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 86B, 86C and 86D do not apply if:  (b) the debtor engaged in fraud, or made a misrepresentation, relating to the reverse mortgage before, at or after the time the credit contract was made; or  (c) circumstances prescribed by the regulations exist."@en ;
