concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-2-sec-21-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2 .
