    skos:prefLabel "133C Guide to this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-133c ;
    values:originalText "This Part has rules that apply to licensees who are, or are to be, credit providers under short-term credit contracts and small amount credit contracts. It applies in addition to the general rules in" ;
