doc:sch-4-sec-31a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31A(1) Restrictions on fees and charges for small amount credit" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A small amount credit contract must not impose or provide for fees and charges if the fees and charges are not of the following kind:  (a) a permitted establishment fee;  (b) a fee or charge (a permitted monthly fee) that is payable on a monthly basis starting on the day the contract is entered into;  (c) a fee or charge that is payable in the event of a default in payment under the contract;  (d) a government fee, charge or duty payable in relation to the contract. Note: See section 39B for the maximum amount that may be recovered by the credit provider if there is a default in payment under the contract." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

