    cof:title "31B(1) Credit provider or prescribed person must not require or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A credit provider, or a person prescribed by the regulations, must not require or accept payment by the debtor of a fee or charge in relation to:  (a) a small amount credit contract; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Caps on costs etc. for credit contracts  Schedule 4  (b) the provision of the amount of credit under a small amount credit contract; or  (c) a thing that is connected with a small amount credit contract or the provision of the amount of credit under such a contract. Criminal penalty: 100 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-4-sec-31b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31B(2) Credit provider or prescribed person must not require or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-31b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the fee or charge is:  (a) a fee or charge that may be imposed or provided for by the small amount credit contract under section 31A; or  (b) a fee or charge prescribed by the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the fee or charge is:  (a) a fee or charge that may be imposed or provided for by the small amount credit contract under section 31A; or  (b) a fee or charge prescribed by the regulations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "70bb0ed11890f3447eea64f872c089be9d5d36b766ff06bcabc5dd693f3a2714" ;
    values:partOf concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-4-sec-31b ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No requirement or charge that may be imposed by the small amount credit contract under section 31A or prescribed by regulations." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
