concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-4-sec-39c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39C Credit provider must do prescribed things if a default in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-39c ;
    values:originalText "payment by direct debit occurs  (1) If:  (a) the amount of repayments under a small amount credit contract are to be paid by way of direct debit; and  (b) the direct debit has been authorised by the debtor; and  (c) a default in the payment of an amount of a repayment occurs; the credit provider must do the things prescribed by the regulations. Criminal penalty: 50 penalty units.  (2) In this section, direct debit has the same meaning as in section 87." ;
    skos:definition "payment by direct debit occurs  (1) If:  (a) the amount of repayments under a small amount credit contract are to be paid by way of direct debit; and  (b) the direct debit has been authorised by the debtor; and  (c) a default in the payment of an amount of a repayment occurs; the credit provider must do the things prescribed by the regulations. Criminal penalty: 50 penalty units.  (2) In this section, direct debit has the same meaning as in section 87."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c3486db2b90b6618ec9c5151a5578335a50cbd1a3f932602c52f500c30ad1ecd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "71"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-4-sec-39c-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-4-sec-39c-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf, p.71" .
