concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-173a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "173A Other forms of consumer lease"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-173a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may authorise other ways of making a consumer lease that do not involve a written document.  (2) In that case, the provisions of this Division apply with such modifications as are prescribed by the regulations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may authorise other ways of making a consumer lease that do not involve a written document.  (2) In that case, the provisions of this Division apply with such modifications as are prescribed by the regulations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases"@en ;
