concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-174a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "174A Alteration of consumer lease document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-174a ;
    values:originalText "(1) An alteration of (including an addition to) a new consumer lease document by the lessor after it is signed by the lessee is ineffective unless the lessee has agreed in writing to the alteration.  (2) This section does not apply to an alteration having the effect of reducing the lessee’s liabilities under the consumer lease." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An alteration of (including an addition to) a new consumer lease document by the lessor after it is signed by the lessee is ineffective unless the lessee has agreed in writing to the alteration.  (2) This section does not apply to an alteration having the effect of reducing the lessee’s liabilities under the consumer lease."@en ;
