doc:sch-5-sec-175b-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "175B(3) Fees or charges in relation to third parties" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Consumer leases  Schedule 5  (a) when the fee or charge is paid by the lessee to the lessor, the third party amount is not ascertainable; and  (b) after the fee or charge is paid, the lessor ascertains the third party amount; and  (c) the third party amount is less than the amount of the fee or charge paid; then the lessor must refund or credit the difference to the lessee. Determining third party amount" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer .

concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-175b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "175B(4) Fees or charges in relation to third parties"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-175b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The third party amount is to be determined by:  (a) taking into account any discount, rebate or other allowance that is received or receivable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001); and  (b) disregarding any rebate on tax payable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of that Act)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The third party amount is to be determined by:  (a) taking into account any discount, rebate or other allowance that is received or receivable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001); and  (b) disregarding any rebate on tax payable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of that Act)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6bffc5e9e5b40725295d70ba8da621c80d2430f408880b2b979a2b476d3187c3" ;
    values:partOf concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-175b ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determine third party amount by considering discounts and allowances received or receivable by the lessor." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf, p.78" ;
    cml:asserts concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-175b-ss-4-norm .
