doc:sch-5-sec-175b-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "175B(4) Fees or charges in relation to third parties" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The third party amount is to be determined by:  (a) taking into account any discount, rebate or other allowance that is received or receivable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001); and  (b) disregarding any rebate on tax payable by the lessor or a related body corporate (within the meaning of that Act)." ;
