concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-175e-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "175E(5) Statement of amount owing and other matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-175e-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A lessor is not required to provide a further written statement under this section if it has, within the 3 months before the request is given, given such a statement to the person requesting it." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A lessor is not required to provide a further written statement under this section if it has, within the 3 months before the request is given, given such a statement to the person requesting it."@en ;
