concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-177b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "177B(5) Changes on grounds of hardship"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-177b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The lessor must give the notice before the end of the period identified using the table. Period for giving notice  If: The period is: The lessor does not require information under subsection (2) 21 days after the day of receiving the hardship notice The lessor requires information under subsection (2) but does not receive any information in compliance with the requirement 28 days after the stated date of the notice under subsection (2) The lessor requires information under subsection (2) and receives information in compliance with the requirement 21 days after the day of receiving the information Regulations may prescribe shorter periods for consumer leases" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The lessor must give the notice before the end of the period identified using the table. Period for giving notice  If: The period is: The lessor does not require information under subsection (2) 21 days after the day of receiving the hardship notice The lessor requires information under subsection (2) but does not receive any information in compliance with the requirement 28 days after the stated date of the notice under subsection (2) The lessor requires information under subsection (2) and receives information in compliance with the requirement 21 days after the day of receiving the information Regulations may prescribe shorter periods for consumer leases"@en ;
