concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-177f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "177F(4) Court may reopen unjust transactions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-177f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In determining whether a consumer lease is unjust, the court is not to have regard to any injustice arising from circumstances that were not reasonably foreseeable when the lease was entered into or changed. Conduct" ;
