doc:sch-5-sec-177f-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "177F(5) Court may reopen unjust transactions" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) In determining whether to grant relief in respect of a consumer lease that it finds to be unjust, the court may have regard to the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Consumer leases  Schedule 5  conduct of the parties to the proceedings in relation to the lease since it was entered into or changed. Application" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer .

