concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179r a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "179R Recovery of enforcement expenses"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-179r ;
    values:originalText "(1) A lessor must not recover or seek to recover enforcement expenses from a lessee in excess of those reasonably incurred by the lessor. Enforcement expenses of a lessor extend to those reasonably incurred by the use of the staff and facilities of the lessor.  (2) Any provision of the consumer lease that appears to confer a greater right is void. If enforcement expenses are in fact recovered in excess of this limitation, they may be recovered back.  (3) If there is a dispute between the lessor and the lessee about the amount of enforcement expenses that may be recovered by the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases  lessor, the court may, on application by any of the parties to the dispute, determine the amount of that liability." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A lessor must not recover or seek to recover enforcement expenses from a lessee in excess of those reasonably incurred by the lessor. Enforcement expenses of a lessor extend to those reasonably incurred by the use of the staff and facilities of the lessor.  (2) Any provision of the consumer lease that appears to confer a greater right is void. If enforcement expenses are in fact recovered in excess of this limitation, they may be recovered back.  (3) If there is a dispute between the lessor and the lessee about the amount of enforcement expenses that may be recovered by the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases  lessor, the court may, on application by any of the parties to the dispute, determine the amount of that liability."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "addb8aa8e3f9dab6ee9df72d9a622a6136fff2afe17f714978595a19d862d22d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179r-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179r-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179r-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012.pdf, p.101" .
