concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179u a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "179U False or misleading representations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-179u ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person must not make a false or misleading representation:  (a) in relation to a matter that is material to entry into a consumer lease or a related transaction; or  (b) in attempting to induce another person to enter into a consumer lease or a related transaction. Criminal penalty: 50 penalty units.  (2) It is a defence to prosecution for an offence against this section if a person charged proves that he or she reasonably believed that the representation was not false or misleading.  (3) A person who suffers loss as a result of a contravention of this section by another person may recover the amount of the loss from: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases  (a) that other person; or  (b) any other person involved in the contravention." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person must not make a false or misleading representation:  (a) in relation to a matter that is material to entry into a consumer lease or a related transaction; or  (b) in attempting to induce another person to enter into a consumer lease or a related transaction. Criminal penalty: 50 penalty units.  (2) It is a defence to prosecution for an offence against this section if a person charged proves that he or she reasonably believed that the representation was not false or misleading.  (3) A person who suffers loss as a result of a contravention of this section by another person may recover the amount of the loss from: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases  (a) that other person; or  (b) any other person involved in the contravention."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "130f11e6aae6a67c59372cccf471fb156138255cd8ee57e767ca593beb87c682" ;
    cof:pageNumber "103"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179u-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179u-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:consumer-credit-legislation-amendment-enhancements-act-2012-sch-5-sec-179u-ss-3 ;
