doc:sch-5-sec-28 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "28 Subsection 204(1) of the National Credit Code (definition" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "of default notice) Repeal the definition, substitute: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00130  Schedule 5  Consumer leases  default notice:  (a) in relation to credit contracts, mortgages and guarantees—see section 88; and  (b) in relation to consumer leases—see section 179D." ;
