    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert: on demand facility means a credit contract or mortgage under which:  (a) the total amount outstanding under the contract or mortgage is repayable at any time on demand by the credit provider; and  (b) there is no agreement, arrangement or understanding between the credit provider and the debtor or mortgagor that repayment will only be demanded on the occurrence or non-occurrence of a particular event." ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer .

